      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "AMRON TOMMY (5) has a terrific record this track and trip with two wins and one placing from three starts. Was out of the placings last time (25.77) at Shepparton in a Grade 5, finishing sixth and beaten 6 lengths. Rates on top and should go close. SERRATED EDGE (2) has been beaten for early speed lately, last time finishing sixth (24.75) in a Special conditions H at this track. The form from his last run is stacking up nicely. Will give the top chances plenty to think about. MY NAME'S EVELYN (8) made it two minor placings on the trot when beaten third (24.29) in a Grade 5 at this track last time out. Expected to do much better this time. DARE DEVIL (4) will need to run right up to last start to feature again.",
